{"id":"redko","lemma":"редко","pos":"adv","rank":1436,"glosses":["rarely, seldom","sparsely"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ef/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я редко его вижу.","en":"I seldom see him.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"}]},{"text":"Я редко говорю о себе.","en":"I seldom talk about myself.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"myself","l":"себя"}]},{"text":"Я редко видел его в школе.","en":"I rarely saw him at school.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/661118","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Это редко случается.","en":"This rarely happens.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,null]},{"text":"Я редко делаю ошибки.","en":"I seldom make mistakes.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},{"g":"mistake, error, fault","l":"ошибка"}]}]}